# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical domain
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When the site answers on more than one domain, pick ONE as canonical and 301
# the others to it. Without this, search engines see two copies of every page
# and split the ranking signal between them.
#
# Uncomment and edit, putting your PRIMARY domain on the right. The :splat
# preserves the rest of the path.
#
# https://alternate-domain.com/*          https://your-primary-domain.com/:splat   301!
# https://www.your-primary-domain.com/*   https://your-primary-domain.com/:splat   301!

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No SPA fallback rule here — on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A `/*  /index.html  200` rule is INVALID on Workers Static Assets: the
# `html_handling: "auto-trailing-slash"` setting already strips `/index` and
# `.html`, so such a rule rewrites `/index.html` back to `/`, matches itself
# again, and Cloudflare rejects the deploy with "Infinite loop detected".
#
# Fallback is configured in wrangler.jsonc via `not_found_handling` instead,
# which serves 404.html (a copy of the app shell) with a correct 404 status.
